In the past 24 hours, liquidations totaled $234 million. BTC short liquidations were 5 times the long liquidations: who is getting squeezed?

In the past 24 hours, total liquidations across the whole network reached $234 million. Among them, BTC and ETH short liquidations were 5 times and 2.8 times the long liquidations, respectively. Prices didn’t surge much, yet the shorts were being cleared out in concentrated fashion.

1. Liquidation Data (Coinglass, ChainCatcher, Aug 7 00:30 quote)

- Across the whole network in the past 24 hours liquidations totaled $234 million: long liquidations $108 million, short liquidations $126 million;
- BTC: long liquidations of $6.2036 million, short liquidations of $31.7862 million. Short liquidations were about 5.1 times the long liquidations, accounting for roughly 16% of total liquidations across the network;
